{
  "title": "Hearty Slovakian Vegetable Stew",
  "description": "A pungent and energizing Slovakian dish featuring vegetable stock and salt-bake, perfect for a cold winter's night, this plant-based-friendly stew is sure to satisfy your hunger.",
