  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and potatoes, and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Pour in the vegetable stock, and add the salt, black pepper, and paprika.",
    "Bring the stew to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste, if using.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with fresh parsley or dill."
